=== PARITY ===
Ported web/src/api/hooks/useAnnotations.ts (2 reads, 3 mutations) ->
AnnotationRepository (S7) + HttpAnnotationRepository + AnnotationsStore (S8).

Reads (2):
 1. useChartAnnotations(params)       -> AnnotationsStore.chartAnnotations(params)
        GET /annotations/?vehicle_id=&scope=&from=&to=  (annotationQuery: vehicle_id sent when present;
        scope/from/to only when non-blank, mirroring web buildQuery truthy guards)
        typed List<ChartAnnotationRow>; cached under annotationCacheKey == web annotationKeys.list tuple.
 2. useChartAnnotationsAsData(params) -> AnnotationsStore.chartAnnotationsAsData(params)
        SAME shared upstream re-projected through toDataAnnotation (single fetch, like the web wrapper
        reusing the same TanStack query key). Web {annotations,isLoading} -> Resource (data + is Loading).

Mutations (3) — each invalidates annotationKeys.all (whole 'annotations' tree):
 3. useCreateAnnotation -> store.createAnnotation(input)  POST /annotations/        body: occurred_at,category,
        title (+ vehicle_id/description/scope/color when present) -> repo clear(domain) + store refreshAll()
 4. useUpdateAnnotation -> store.updateAnnotation(input)  PATCH /annotations/{id}   body: only changed fields,
        clear_description/clear_color only when set -> repo clear(domain) + store refreshAll()
 5. useDeleteAnnotation -> store.deleteAnnotation(id)     DELETE /annotations/{id}  204 No Content ->
        repo clear(domain) + store refreshAll()

Invalidate-all semantics: web invalidateAndBroadcast(qc, {queryKey: annotationKeys.all}) drops every
(vehicle,scope,window) query => repo evicts the ENTIRE CacheDomain.Annotations partition and the store's
refreshAll() bumps every observed feed (raw + the as-data feeds re-derive automatically). A failed mutation
leaves the cache untouched (asserted). A feed nobody observes is a no-op refresh (asserted).

Derivations golden-locked (KMP+C# parity, AnnotationsGoldenTest, ADR-004):
  - toDataAnnotation (id stringified, context = first scope bucket, null-preserving description/vehicle id)
  - annotationQuery   (vehicle_id always-when-present; blank scope/from/to dropped)
  - annotationCacheKey (web annotationKeys.list null-coalescing; empty scope stays '' in the KEY though
    it is dropped from the QUERY — the one subtle web edge, pinned by 'empty_scope_stays_empty').

SI preserved: annotation fields are ids/timestamps/titles/hex colours — not unit-bearing — so they
round-trip verbatim as typed ChartAnnotationRow JSON; conversion is display-only (S5). New cache domain
Annotations = 5 min (matches web STALE_TIMES.SLOW on useChartAnnotations).

Endpoints verified against generated apps/windows/Generated/Api/ApiEndpoints.cs and internal/api/router.go
(/annotations Get/Post, /annotations/{id} Patch/Delete) and the Go handler
internal/api/chartannotation/handler.go (wire shape + create/patch body fields).

